# =====================================================\n# PAGES PACKAGE - Page Object Classes\n# =====================================================\n# This package contains all the Page Object classes\n#\n# PAGE OBJECT MODEL PATTERN:\n# Instead of writing test code that knows all the HTML details,\n# we create a \"page object\" for each page of the website.\n# Each page object:\n# - Stores the locations (selectors) of all elements on that page\n# - Provides methods to perform actions on that page\n# - Shields test code from HTML changes\n#\n# BENEFITS:\n# - Tests are more readable: home.go_to_lipsticks() is clear\n# - If HTML changes, only page objects need updates\n# - Easy to reuse page objects across multiple tests\n# - Better organization and maintenance\n#\n# PAGES INCLUDED:\n# - base_page.py: Parent class with common methods\n# - home_page.py: Home page actions\n# - login_page.py: Login page actions\n# - signup_page.py: Registration page actions\n# - product_list_page.py: Product list/grid actions\n# - product_detail_page.py: Individual product page actions\n# - cart_page.py: Shopping cart actions\n# - checkout_page.py: Payment/checkout page actions\n
